ZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2025-08-15T11:47:00Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T12:27:58Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible on 4.5beta5\n\n### System information\n\nPixel 9A - Android 15\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs the title says loading assets from PCK files is almost 10 times slower than loading directly from the APK.\nOn the same export of the example platformer project splitting the assets into a PCK slows down loading time from:\n`loading time: 0.216000 secs`\nto:\n`loading time: 1.760000 secs`\n\nOn a different project from the attached MRP it can take up to 8 seconds to load a single model from a PCK.\nI don't know if this is expected, seems excessively slow to me.\nNot sure if this is related to #102998\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Export the assets in a PCK (making sure not to include them in the APK)\n- Load the PCK with `ProjectSettings.load_resource_pack`\n- Play\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe attached project is already setup with the 3 necessary export profiles and a script to load the PCK from `/storage/emulated/0/platformer.pck`.\nYou might have to restart the game after granting permissions for it to work\n[platformer_slow_pck.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21794192/platformer_slow_pck.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109635/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109635/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}